00:49:48.000 --> 00:50:15.000
And the 1780s become the 1790s, and still from Boswell, there is no sign of this long promised, long anticipated life of Johnson. And so both his friends and his enemies are endlessly, you know, the friends are saying, get a move on. His enemies are saying, ha, ha, ha, you're useless, you're an old drunk, you're never going to publish it. And it's true that the chaos of his own life, you know, the whoring and the drinking and the growing debts.
嗯，他喝了很多酒，不是吗？到这个时候已经大量了。我的意思是，这些显然是他觉得很难完成他的书的原因。但我认为这也归因于别的东西。那就是一种感觉，实际上他的传记，他正处于伟大事业的边缘，他生活中的其他一切都是灾难。但如果他能把这本传记写好，那么这将是他的纪念碑。你知道，他将取得一些伟大的成就。

