00:50:15.000 --> 00:50:40.000
Well, he is drinking a lot, isn't he? massive amounts by this point. I mean, these are clearly factors why he's finding it hard to finish his book. But I think it is also due to something more. And that is a sense that actually with his biography, he is on the verge of something great, that everything else in his life is a disaster. But if he can get this biography right, then that will be his memorial. You know, he will have achieved something wonderful.
他的野心既简单又傲慢。写一种从未写过的传记，用他在传记引言中最终写下的词来描绘约翰逊，比迄今为止活过的任何人都更完整。所以他让罗伯特·卡罗，那个写这些关于林登·约翰逊生平的6000页书的人。他让他看起来像个小册子作者，不是吗？因为鲍斯韦尔想核对每一个事实，他想和约翰逊的每一个同事交谈。他想写出完整的权威传记，毫无疑问，没有未问或未回答的问题。

